 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Don’t Worry, We Both Agreed to this Fraudulent Marriage"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "걱정 마세요, 합의된 사기 결혼입니다"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Duke Yulrikian, whose family was lost in a power struggle, pretends to be reckless to avoid the emperor's attention. To further ruin his reputation, he enters a contract marriage with a mysterious woman named Madi from the slums. As they navigate their fake relationship, they grow closer, uncovering each other's secrets and developing unexpected feelings."
  },
